sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Guest
    participant Folio
    participant Auth as UserController
    participant JWT as JwtUtils
    participant Redis
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Security as Spring Security

    User->>Folio: Continue as guest
    Folio->>Auth: POST /users/guest-login + guest cookie
    alt valid cookie and GUEST exists
        Auth->>JWT: validate refresh token
        Auth->>DB: findByUsername
        DB-->>Auth: reuse GUEST user
    else no reusable guest
        Auth->>Redis: atomic shared daily-attempt check
        alt guest-login limit exceeded or Redis unavailable
            Redis-->>Auth: fail closed
            Auth-->>Folio: 429 or 503
        else allowed
            Auth->>DB: create GUEST user
            Auth->>JWT: generate refresh token
        end
    end
    Auth->>JWT: generate access token
    Auth-->>Folio: token + HttpOnly cookie
    Folio->>Auth: GET /users/me
    Auth-->>Folio: server-owned role = GUEST
    Note right of Security: GUEST can chat and search own history<br/>Upload requires USER or ADMIN<br/>Admin APIs require ADMIN
